get_customer_policy: description  -account, guest-booking +account/guest eligibility -pickup-lead-time +pickup lead-time -before +for -Use +Call after -for service scope +and before quote_ride -quote_ride for pricing; +prepare_offer. This tool answers purchase eligibility, not price, capacity, or authority to amend/cancel an existing booking. Selection and timing: - Retain the selected offerKey across the workflow; locale changes language without changing location. A different offerKey requires a fresh policy read. - Interpret intended pickup in returned timeZone; compare the interval from now with terms.minimumLeadTimeMinutes
